@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra server -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Chi tiet bai tap ton tai -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 4. Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 + ApiError (ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 5. Nop bai hop le cho bai tap 1 -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv001/rest-api" }

### 6. Doc lai luot nop vua tao theo Location -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. Nop bai vao bai tap da dong (ID=3) -> 400 + ApiError (ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv001/docker" }

### 8. Nop bai thieu du lieu -> 400 + ApiError (INVALID_SUBMISSION)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "", "repositoryUrl": "" }

### 9. Nop bai vao bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 + ApiError (ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv001/rest-api" }

### 10. Luot nop khong ton tai -> 404 + ApiError (SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 11. Thieu Content-Type -> 415
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/sv001/rest-api" }
